<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian investment fund SPDIT 96 net up.</title>
<headline>Tunisian investment fund SPDIT 96 net up.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian closed-ended investment fund Societe de Placement et de Developpement Industriel et Touristique  SPDI made a 2.357 million dinars net profits in 1996, up from 1.854 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The company, which is listed at the Tunis Stock Exchange, said it would distribute a dividend of 0.7 dinar per share.</p>
<p>SPDIT's capital and reserves were 36.534 million dinars at the end of 1996. ($=1.0957 dinar)</p>
<p>- Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
